# Only the server's .env is a secret (has a local-only credential file path;
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY/GEMINI_API_KEY are passed via --set-env-vars at deploy time
# instead). apps/web/client/.env holds Firebase's public web config, which
# Vite must read at build time to bake into the client bundle — never
# excluded here.
